{
  "$comment": "D1 retired-name deny-list: names removed by a hard cutover. Test/lint data only, never read by the runtime; no new names and no old-to-new mapping (the strict unknown-field error names the replacement). scope: field = output key, lead = next/hints key, input = query field, code = errorCode. tools limits an entry to those tools' outputs and inputs. Prose scan (docs-verify): text:true scans for the whole word; pattern (a regex) scans for that context instead, for common words; allow lists path prefixes where the text keeps another meaning.",
